# Keep the build context small and the images clean. Anything a build does not read, or that a
# container should never carry, is excluded here — most importantly host-built artefacts (a Linux
# image must never inherit a Windows .venv or node_modules) and secrets.
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Host-built dependency trees — reinstalled inside the image for the right platform.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv

# Python and tool caches.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
coverage.xml
**/coverage

# Frontend build output — produced inside the web image, never copied in.
**/dist

# Runtime data lives in a mounted volume, not baked into an image.
data

# Secrets never enter an image; config is injected as environment at run time.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Teaching material and local scratch.
docs/aulas
*.log
